One note: I left `TempDebugAccess` untouched since the ticket scoped this fix to `LegacyAdminAccess` only, but it has the identical `Action = "*"` / `Resource = "*"` pattern, so Checkov will very likely still flag CKV_AWS_62 on this policy (the rule typically evaluates each statement, and can also fail on a document containing any full-admin statement). Worth confirming with whoever filed the ticket whether that statement is in scope too, or expected to be removed separately.
